          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">You can usually return a treadmill, but budget for it.</strong>
            Restocking fees, freight collection and non-refundable delivery charges can add up to a
            quarter or a third of the price on a change-of-mind return. A clear, forgiving policy is
            worth paying a little more for, especially if you have not
            <a href="/treadmills-for-sale/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">tried the machine in person</a>.
          </p>
